Data Sources Attribution:

This software collects data from the following public threat intelligence feeds:

1. Feodo Tracker (https://feodotracker.abuse.ch/)
   - Operated by abuse.ch
   - Terms: https://feodotracker.abuse.ch/blocklist/

2. URLhaus (https://urlhaus.abuse.ch/)
   - Operated by abuse.ch
   - Terms: https://urlhaus.abuse.ch/api/

3. MalwareBazaar (https://bazaar.abuse.ch/)
   - Operated by abuse.ch
   - Terms: https://bazaar.abuse.ch/faq/#tos

4. Spamhaus DROP (https://www.spamhaus.org/drop/)
   - Operated by The Spamhaus Project
   - Terms: https://www.spamhaus.org/organization/dnsbllists/

All collected data is sourced from publicly available feeds and is subject to
the terms of use of the respective data providers. Users of this software are
responsible for complying with the terms of service of these data sources.
